# my-plex.tests.links -- tests linked to a definition they do not name (my-rollout's README,
# "A tool adopts the commit gate"): <definition> TAB <test title> TAB <the case>.
# my-rollout's gate runs a test whose function names a touched definition; these
# lines add the tests that reach one only by running my-plex as a program.
